      "text": "Separation alone is insufficient: two classes could exhibit identical centroid separation while one\nforms a tight cluster and the other a diffuse cloud. We track Concept Coherence as the explained\nvariance ratio of the first principal component of the full pooled activation matrix at each layer:\n",
