      "font_size": 11.02,
      "font_name": "LMRoman10-Regular",
      "is_math": false,
      "char_count": 646,
      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.24856_p11_b26",
      "text": "In plain terms: coherence asks \u201cis the concept encoded as a single clean direction, or is it smeared\nacross many dimensions?\u201d Precision note: because C(l) is fitted on the pooled (both-class\ncombined) activation matrix, it measures the dominant direction of total variance, which may\n",
